{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/claydon-house-ellington-mbr-city","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":637,"crm_id":"1017","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Claydon House","slug":"claydon-house-ellington-mbr-city","display_address":"MBR City","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Ellington Properties","price":1747828,"display_price":"1.74M","lattitude":25.179711,"longitude":55.3171151,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Claydon House is a project by developer Ellington Properties located in the Mohammed Bin Rashid neighborhood. The complex is designed in a modern style and is a multi-storey 38-storey building with stunning views of the Ras El Khor Wildlife Sanctuary and direct access to the crystal clear lagoon with a length of 2 km. Spacious <strong>1,2,3 and 4 bedroom apartments</strong> are available for sale. The interiors are made in a modern style that create a cozy atmosphere. Through panoramic windows, the rooms are filled with natural light, which visually expands the space and offers spectacular views of the amazing surroundings of the area.</p><p>Premium world-class amenities are provided for residents, including an elevated gym, swimming pools, recreation areas, Montessori children's area, clubhouses with a library, and an entertainment space for gambling.</p><p>Claydon House is located 5 minutes from Ras El Khor Wildlife Sanctuary, 15 minutes to Burj Khalifa, Dubai Mall and Business Bay, approximately 20 minutes to Dubai Hills Golf Club and Dubai Creek Golf and Yacht Club, and Dubai International Airport, only 17 minutes.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1017/images/2024/03/01/kPbxyMfeEKL4XAVY7JDsCveOwOG1y05Xf337